WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
Come back with me, three meals a day, stew with meat

2
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:06,830
You don't have to do anything, just do research

3
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:09,190
I'll get the scientific research equipment back for you.

4
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:12,700
Captain Han, we still have family members

5
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:16,500
I want all these people, but they also have to work when they arrive at my base.

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,300
I don’t want unproductive people

7
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,500
But what work can they do?

8
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,700
Farming, raising pigs, lots of life

9
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:26,300
Just chop it dry, stew the rice, stew the pork

10
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:28,100
Snacks, new clothes, all available

11
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:34,390
Stewed white rice, stewed pork, is he talking about heaven?

12
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:37,390
Teacher, we won't go, my wife is not in good health

13
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:39,990
The family has finally stabilized and no longer wants to travel around

14
00:00:39,990 --> 00:00:43,190
Kang Jian, it is precisely because of her poor health that she should come with us

15
00:00:43,190 --> 00:00:44,590
This is a rare opportunity, don't miss it

16
00:00:44,590 --> 00:00:46,990
When we get there, there will be jobs, food to eat, and a house to live in. We don’t want to
